# Enterprise Contact Identity — Restore Experience

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Sprint: **CO-CONTACT-IDENTITY-001**

## Non-negotiable

One Enterprise Identity · One Mobile · One Contact · One History.

Do **not** redesign the Contact Registry, unique indexes, or soft-delete model.

## Create flow

Search registry by mobile → Active (open) · Soft-deleted (restore dialog) · None (create).

Never show Prisma/SQL. Never “Create New Anyway”.

